cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this repository, please cite the archived release using its version-specific DOI and the associated research article when available."
type: software
title: "Competitive–Cooperative Organizational Intelligence for Adaptive Secure Image Sharing over Heterogeneous Multipath Networks"
abstract: >-
  Research code and experimental materials supporting a competitive–cooperative
  organizational intelligence framework for adaptive secure image sharing over
  heterogeneous multipath networks. The framework integrates protected task
  ownership, competitive allocation, cooperative recovery, and joint adaptive
  optimization under security and resource constraints.
keywords:
  - secure image sharing
  - competitive-cooperative organizational intelligence
  - heterogeneous multipath networks
  - multi-agent coordination
  - cooperative recovery
  - adaptive optimization
license: CC-BY-4.0
version: 1.0.0
date-released: 2026-10-28
